meta {
  name: Get Trip As Calendar Format
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/trip/calendar
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Trip As Calendar Format

  This request is used to get all trip data but in calendar format. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and has protected routes.

  ## Responses

  **200 — Trip fetched successfully.** Ordered in descending order by `created_at`
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "trip fetched",
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "28668090-5653-dff5-2d8f-af603fc36b45",
        "trip_location_name": "Location A - Location B",
        "vehicle_plate_number": "D 1710 PWT",
        "created_at": "2024-03-19 02:37:58"
      }
    ]
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — trip failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "trip not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}